1
00:00:01,624 --> 00:00:04,379
Guardian of the Forest

2
00:00:11,878 --> 00:00:14,676
Check out this explosion of art, haha!

3
00:00:18,782 --> 00:00:21,736
Hahaha! Something exploded, alright!

4
00:00:21,774 --> 00:00:22,603
What did you say?!

5
00:00:22,603 --> 00:00:23,643
Nothing...

6
00:00:23,643 --> 00:00:25,545
Get out of here now...

7
00:00:26,280 --> 00:00:27,437
That wasn't me!

8
00:00:27,437 --> 00:00:29,551
I said, get out!

9
00:00:29,736 --> 00:00:32,323
W-what was that?!

10
00:00:34,835 --> 00:00:35,750
V-Vance!

11
00:00:37,835 --> 00:00:39,923
Aaah!

12
00:00:40,938 --> 00:00:44,554
Hahaha! A monster?!

13
00:00:44,554 --> 00:00:46,197
You expect us to believe that?!

14
00:00:46,197 --> 00:00:47,948
We really saw it, you guys!

15
00:00:47,948 --> 00:00:50,180
It had a long neck, sharp teeth, and it even said,

16
00:00:50,180 --> 00:00:53,988
"Get out of this forest!" It spoke to us!!!

17
00:00:53,988 --> 00:00:56,216
The monster could even talk?

18
00:00:56,216 --> 00:00:58,329
There's no way.

19
00:00:58,329 --> 00:01:01,405
You better hurry home today so you don't see it again!

20
00:01:01,405 --> 00:01:03,392
I swear it's true!

21
00:01:03,392 --> 00:01:05,599
Making up stories about monsters?

22
00:01:05,599 --> 00:01:07,459
Even I could come up with something more believable than that.

23
00:01:07,459 --> 00:01:09,793
You mean... like robots from space?

24
00:01:10,673 --> 00:01:12,287
Crest?!

25
00:01:12,287 --> 00:01:14,975
W-what do you mean by robots, Crest?

26
00:01:14,975 --> 00:01:17,707
Y-yeah, w-what are you talking about?

27
00:01:17,707 --> 00:01:20,743
It seems like strange things happen quite often in this town.

28
00:01:20,743 --> 00:01:25,150
Don't you think it might be too early to dismiss Vance's story as just a tall tale?

29
00:01:25,150 --> 00:01:30,510
There's been a series of accidents taking place at the new highway being constructed in the north of Mowtown.

30
00:01:30,510 --> 00:01:34,590
All the workers on-site said the exact same thing.

31
00:01:34,590 --> 00:01:36,712
That a giant monster appeared from within the fog.

32
00:01:36,712 --> 00:01:38,445
What?!

33
00:01:38,445 --> 00:01:40,551
Don't you think it's worth checking out?

34
00:02:00,256 --> 00:02:02,489
Waaah!!

35
00:02:04,240 --> 00:02:06,718
You mean to tell me there's monsters like that here on Earth?!

36
00:02:06,718 --> 00:02:10,487
There weren't any monsters like that back on planet Machina!

37
00:02:10,487 --> 00:02:14,804
Don't worry. It's only a movie, you guys.

38
00:02:14,804 --> 00:02:16,507
Of course. I knew it wasn't real.

39
00:02:16,507 --> 00:02:17,548
Blue Cop!

40
00:02:18,207 --> 00:02:18,973
Jun.

41
00:02:19,496 --> 00:02:21,179
Let's go monster hunting!

42
00:02:21,329 --> 00:02:22,968
What?! Monster?!

43
00:02:24,960 --> 00:02:26,479
You're kidding, right?!

44
00:02:26,479 --> 00:02:26,425
Huh?

45
00:02:26,425 --> 00:02:27,905
Go hunt them yourself!

46
00:02:27,905 --> 00:02:29,719
What's going on?

47
00:02:29,719 --> 00:02:30,639
Beats me.

48
00:02:36,468 --> 00:02:40,800
So you think the monster behind the rumors could actually be a Metal Cardbot?

49
00:02:40,800 --> 00:02:42,811
That does seem to be the most likely story.

50
00:02:42,811 --> 00:02:46,692
I wonder how much Crest knows about the Metal Cardbots?

51
00:02:46,692 --> 00:02:48,320
That's been bothering me too.

52
00:02:48,320 --> 00:02:50,774
But we need to focus on figuring out who this monster is first.

53
00:02:50,774 --> 00:02:52,909
Okay, we're here.

54
00:02:55,560 --> 00:02:56,469
Crest!

55
00:02:56,469 --> 00:02:58,224
Hey guys. I was waiting for you.

56
00:02:58,224 --> 00:02:59,429
Yeah. Let's go.

57
00:03:01,828 --> 00:03:03,631
He's not a very good artist.

58
00:03:03,631 --> 00:03:05,259
Looks just like Vance.

59
00:03:05,259 --> 00:03:07,171
Be careful, master.

60
00:03:13,872 --> 00:03:16,621
Is it okay to be here without permission?

61
00:03:16,621 --> 00:03:21,433
Construction has been suspended since the accidents. All that remains is...

62
00:03:22,677 --> 00:03:23,848
Waah!

63
00:03:24,930 --> 00:03:26,259
Wildlife. Like that raccoon.

64
00:03:29,750 --> 00:03:32,245
There's a lot of animals around here.

65
00:03:32,245 --> 00:03:34,449
There used to be a lot around the car center too.

66
00:03:34,449 --> 00:03:37,733
They disappeared as the city continued to be developed.

67
00:03:37,733 --> 00:03:42,439
Look, over there!

68
00:03:42,439 --> 00:03:43,354
Is that a footprint?

69
00:03:43,354 --> 00:03:44,512
It's huge!

70
00:03:44,512 --> 00:03:45,990
It couldn't belong to an animal.

71
00:03:45,990 --> 00:03:48,328
About 12 meters in height.

72
00:03:48,328 --> 00:03:50,996
Bigger than the robot we saw last time.

73
00:03:51,706 --> 00:03:54,473
We can't say for sure it was a robot!

74
00:03:54,473 --> 00:03:58,435
Yeah! It could be part of a conspiracy trying to cover up what's going on!

75
00:03:58,435 --> 00:04:00,598
What kind of conspiracy theory is that?

76
00:04:03,400 --> 00:04:05,769
Watch out, Jun. Something's close.

77
00:04:06,199 --> 00:04:08,313
Get out now!

78
00:04:09,298 --> 00:04:10,530
What's that?

79
00:04:10,530 --> 00:04:12,795
Get out right now!

80
00:04:20,893 --> 00:04:22,194
Which way did that come from?!

81
00:04:24,608 --> 00:04:28,163
Get out of this forest...

82
00:04:28,163 --> 00:04:29,903
...RIGHT NOW!!

83
00:04:30,899 --> 00:04:32,606
It's a monster!!

84
00:04:33,451 --> 00:04:34,509
Who's there?!

85
00:04:37,403 --> 00:04:39,329
An excavator?

86
00:04:39,329 --> 00:04:40,625
Careful, Jun. That's...

87
00:04:40,625 --> 00:04:44,432
Didn't you hear me?! I said, GET OUT!

88
00:04:44,432 --> 00:04:47,680
Waah!!

89
00:04:51,792 --> 00:04:53,492
Let's hide under there!

90
00:04:53,495 --> 00:04:53,493
!

91
00:04:58,199 --> 00:04:59,382
Uncle Edo, hurry up!

92
00:05:03,538 --> 00:05:04,478
I can't fit!

93
00:05:04,478 --> 00:05:06,189
That's what happens when you have all those muscles!

94
00:05:08,370 --> 00:05:08,715
Over there!

95
00:05:15,615 --> 00:05:17,761
Phew, I'm safe.

96
00:05:17,956 --> 00:05:21,218
I told you to get out of here!

97
00:05:29,478 --> 00:05:29,350
!

98
00:05:32,637 --> 00:05:33,906
Uncle Edo!

99
00:05:38,562 --> 00:05:39,733
Uncle!

100
00:05:42,526 --> 00:05:44,793
The monster turned out to be a Metal Cardbot after all.

101
00:05:44,793 --> 00:05:47,978
What do I do? I can't summon them with Crest around.

102
00:05:47,978 --> 00:05:49,394
Let go of him!

103
00:05:50,406 --> 00:05:52,110
Wait a moment, Crest!

104
00:05:52,110 --> 00:05:53,470
Hey!

105
00:05:53,569 --> 00:05:55,538
Why are you chasing people away?

106
00:05:57,129 --> 00:05:59,399
I don't like humans.

107
00:05:59,399 --> 00:06:00,322
What did we do?

108
00:06:00,322 --> 00:06:02,745
You really don't know?

109
00:06:02,745 --> 00:06:05,237
It's because you're all destroying the forests.

110
00:06:05,237 --> 00:06:09,819
Every time the humans expand the roads, creatures of the forest lose their home.

111
00:06:09,819 --> 00:06:10,983
That's why I-

112
00:06:10,983 --> 00:06:14,233
Why you pretended to be a monster to chase people out and to destroy the construction site?

113
00:06:14,233 --> 00:06:16,706
Yeah. Something wrong with that?

114
00:06:16,706 --> 00:06:19,564
Acting like a guardian of the forest...

115
00:06:19,564 --> 00:06:21,814
While using violence to suppress others?

116
00:06:21,814 --> 00:06:25,910
What's the difference between that and what the humans you hate are doing?

117
00:06:28,298 --> 00:06:28,978
Shut up!

118
00:06:29,279 --> 00:06:30,627
Waah!

119
00:06:30,627 --> 00:06:31,709
Uncle Edo!

120
00:06:31,709 --> 00:06:36,569
Do you even know... how many forest creatures have been sacrificed...

121
00:06:36,569 --> 00:06:38,343
all because of humans?!

122
00:06:55,970 --> 00:06:56,776
Crest!

123
00:06:59,340 --> 00:07:00,146
Crest!

124
00:07:00,442 --> 00:07:02,685
Don't worry about me. Just run!

125
00:07:02,685 --> 00:07:04,569
I know you wouldn't run if it were me lying there!

126
00:07:05,581 --> 00:07:07,247
Jun? Are you going to show him?!

127
00:07:07,247 --> 00:07:09,254
The secret of the Metal Cardbots?

128
00:07:09,466 --> 00:07:11,180
Metal Cardbot, pick-

129
00:07:24,579 --> 00:07:25,204
Is that...

130
00:07:25,204 --> 00:07:26,464
Wild Guardy!

131
00:07:26,707 --> 00:07:28,292
All of you, get out of here.

132
00:07:29,848 --> 00:07:31,899
Guys! Please take care of Crest!

133
00:07:31,899 --> 00:07:32,742
Got it!

134
00:07:34,439 --> 00:07:36,336
Crest, are you okay?!

135
00:07:36,531 --> 00:07:38,569
I-I think I can walk...

136
00:07:38,569 --> 00:07:40,569
Hold on tight!

137
00:07:41,884 --> 00:07:44,699
And what about me, guys?...

138
00:07:44,699 --> 00:07:45,485
Waah!

139
00:07:47,338 --> 00:07:48,300
You?

140
00:07:48,300 --> 00:07:50,159
You dare injure a human being?

141
00:07:50,159 --> 00:07:52,413
You are a disgrace to the Metal Cardbots!

142
00:07:55,610 --> 00:07:57,100
Oh!

143
00:07:57,100 --> 00:07:59,790
Master Crest!

144
00:07:59,790 --> 00:08:01,288
How did this happen?!

145
00:08:01,288 --> 00:08:03,887
That didn't go... as well as I hoped...

146
00:08:03,887 --> 00:08:04,767
Crest!

147
00:08:04,767 --> 00:08:05,279
Oh!

148
00:08:05,279 --> 00:08:07,406
Master Crest, sir!

149
00:08:10,545 --> 00:08:13,389
I can't see anything!

150
00:08:13,389 --> 00:08:14,764
Be prepared, Dexter.

151
00:08:14,764 --> 00:08:16,920
I, Wild Guardy, will take you down!

152
00:08:16,920 --> 00:08:18,829
Hold on!

153
00:08:19,872 --> 00:08:23,764
If he hates humans that much, he won't open up to us no matter what we do!

154
00:08:23,764 --> 00:08:25,518
Please, leave it to us!

155
00:08:25,518 --> 00:08:26,934
Us?

156
00:08:33,563 --> 00:08:35,240
Metal Breath, pickup!

157
00:08:36,972 --> 00:08:38,554
Blue Cop, setup!

158
00:08:46,709 --> 00:08:50,399
Out of my way, Blue Cop! Dexter is mine to punish.

159
00:08:50,399 --> 00:08:53,943
Wild Guardy, can't you see? That won't solve anything.

160
00:08:53,943 --> 00:08:56,269
That's none of my concern.

161
00:08:56,269 --> 00:08:58,707
That heap of scrap hurt my friend!

162
00:08:58,707 --> 00:08:59,683
What?!

163
00:09:03,820 --> 00:09:05,715
You can't run away from me!

164
00:09:08,850 --> 00:09:09,693
Stop it!

165
00:09:12,971 --> 00:09:15,943
I have no intention of listening to you!

166
00:09:19,679 --> 00:09:21,769
Mega Ambler, it's your turn!

167
00:09:29,881 --> 00:09:32,118
I'll leave this to you, Mega Ambler!

168
00:09:32,118 --> 00:09:33,628
Got it!

169
00:09:33,628 --> 00:09:35,381
You're going to have to settle for me.

170
00:09:36,105 --> 00:09:37,375
Don't be ridiculous!

171
00:09:37,876 --> 00:09:37,800
!

172
00:09:39,528 --> 00:09:41,591
Where... am I?

173
00:09:44,624 --> 00:09:45,669
Huh?

174
00:09:54,542 --> 00:09:56,359
Here! Blue Cop!

175
00:09:59,951 --> 00:10:01,336
Dexter! Stop!

176
00:10:03,273 --> 00:10:05,452
Stop following me!

177
00:10:13,779 --> 00:10:15,283
Blue Cop! Are you alright?

178
00:10:15,956 --> 00:10:18,316
That was a powerful attack.

179
00:10:20,673 --> 00:10:24,746
Blue Cop! Let's use the Infinity Force Break to end this right now!

180
00:10:24,746 --> 00:10:26,892
Infinity Force Break?

181
00:10:29,528 --> 00:10:31,269
Infinity...

182
00:10:31,269 --> 00:10:32,311
Force...

183
00:10:32,311 --> 00:10:33,738
Break!!

184
00:10:40,192 --> 00:10:44,169
But... if we use it here, the tunnel could collapse.

185
00:10:44,169 --> 00:10:45,585
But...

186
00:10:46,677 --> 00:10:47,908
Dexter is gone!

187
00:10:47,908 --> 00:10:49,195
Let's go after him!

188
00:10:53,601 --> 00:10:54,636
Woah, look out!

189
00:11:01,857 --> 00:11:02,881
What's this?